          <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
              <div className="flex justify-center items-center flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                      <span className="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-medium)] text-lg">Developed by</span>
                      <a href="https://wa.me/201110100881" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <img src="https://i.ibb.co/ccBHkDKH/b9c99d1b-58d1-460b-80cf-5e58fa2f16ac-rwc-4x0x705x400x4096-Copy.png" alt="Developer Logo" className="h-14 object-contain" />
                      </a>
                  </div>
              </div>
              <div className="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 opacity-60">
                  <p className="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                    تواصل معي بشكل مباشر إذا واجهت أي مشكلة أو عندك فكرة لتطويرها أو شاركني اهتمامك للاستمرار ❤️
                  </p>
                  <p className="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl italic">
                    Contact me directly if you face any issues, have an idea for improvement, or share your interest to keep this project going ❤️
                  </p>
