                </h3>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2d3748;"><strong>السوق المستهدف:</strong> <span style="color: #ff0000;">${project.targetMarket}</span></p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2d3748;"><strong>اللهجة المعتمدة:</strong> <span style="color: #ff0000;">${project.dialect}</span></p>
